{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id244985961"}, "name":{"label":"Jnoell"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-05T21:04:32-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.7"}, "id":{"label":"14033193361"}, "title":{"label":"Runs HOT & Drains battery like crazy"}, "content":{"label":"So I really did use to love this app, so much so that I’ve been using the premium version for over a year now actually, however it’s no longer worth it unfortunately… \n\nWithin the past few months anytime I open the app on my phone now it starts to drain my battery like crazy. I’m talking every 30 seconds I loose one percent battery at least! And that’s just if I have the app open. Once I start trying to actually time block too then my phone starts to get super glitchy & run extremely hot as well. So hot that only after a few min of using the app my phone will soon be burning my hands up & I’ll have to let it cool off before I can use it again. This is not normal! \n\nAt first I thought maybe my phones battery was just starting to go bad since I’ll admit I may not have the newest iPhone on the market, & sure my battery isn’t as great as it once was, but this is in fact the only app that causes me problems & force closing this application is the only thing that instantly solves all those problems. Therefore it’s definitely not exclusively an issue with my battery, but rather within the app itself. \n\nUltimately I’m not sure what bug randomly brought this on, but I suspect that if I do attempt to keep using this app then I really will start to have issues with my phones battery as no app should ever cause a phone to get that hot!\nEspecially a simple calendar app you’d think?\n\nThat said, sadly I’m left with no other choice than to cancel my yearly membership & delete this glitchy thing off my phone ASAP before it has the chance to do anymore damage. The only reason I haven’t deleted it yet is cuz I was hoping the next update would resolve these issues. Alas, multiple app updates later, including multiple phone updates later, & I’m still having problems so I simply can’t risk it anymore. Clearly this bug isn’t going away…", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
