{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1213255783"}, "name":{"label":"uruehdbxkjx"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-04T14:16:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.7"}, "id":{"label":"14028724627"}, "title":{"label":"Tons of bugs"}, "content":{"label":"I like the format but it’s unusable on my MacBook. Whenever it’s open my computer gets extremely hot, whenever I try to edit the colors the dropper and colors glitch all over the screen and feel like I’m going to have a seizure (that’s if it lets me edit them at all, most of the time it won’t). I had to switch to the web app because the actually Mac app just does not work at all, I can do maybe 2 things on it and then it freezes up I have to force quit. Wish I hadn’t paid for a subscription. There are way too many issues.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
