{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1420309799"}, "name":{"label":"nunya beeswax the third"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-18T17:05:07-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.7"}, "id":{"label":"13972824090"}, "title":{"label":"Pretty but useless"}, "content":{"label":"I wanted an app that I could make a visual schedule in but it won't even work for that, just trying to set a task for sleeping kept making it bug out and reset the task time to 1 minute and it wouldn't wrap around past midnight to the next day. Combined with the pointless AI features being pushed constantly and all good icons being paywalled, I have less than zero interest in trying to continue using this app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id121549772"}, "name":{"label":"Danno Roberts"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-18T10:36:46-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.7"}, "id":{"label":"13971846424"}, "title":{"label":"The best for my type of ADHD, and I tried a few"}, "content":{"label":"The app is very easy to manage and simple. It’s not cumbersome. It’s not cluttered. It’s not confusing.\nWHAT WE NEED: for people like me with my particular ADHD I suffer from time blindness and require nudging every hour. The chime apps for iPhone are terrible. You could build a chime within Structure or the option for a task to repeat hourly within a set schedule. You currently don’t have this. ADHD folk come in different strokes and our needs are diverse. I am a pay subscriber.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id454084964"}, "name":{"label":"mimibaguette"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-18T06:07:21-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.7"}, "id":{"label":"13970972837"}, "title":{"label":"love it, but really want an updated monthly view and cloud"}, "content":{"label":"this app is great for me—i particularly enjoy the look of the ui and the ability to sort unscheduled tasks into the inbox. but i would love for the monthly view that is accessible on the web app to make it to mac and android. i just find it a little cumbersome scrolling through weeks at a time to see if i scheduled a particular task. also, the android app’s cloud feature doesn’t work very well.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
